    "title": "Appeal filed in lawsuit over public defender delays - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WBAY news staff ,\n8 hours ago GREEN BAY, Wis. (WBAY) - We are hearing more about arguments this week from a group of court defendants suing the state over long delays in getting a public defender. They took the case to the state Court of Appeals after a Brown County judge denied class-action status earlier this year. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
